note Learn-only content and browser assets. Compiled by the pinned site omc.
text slintro "<article class=\"learn-page prose\"><header class=\"learn-intro page-intro\"><p class=\"learn-eyebrow\">Learn with AI / Start here</p><h1>You belong here.<br>Build with AI.</h1><p class=\"learn-lede\">You can start with an idea and ordinary words. You do not need to know how to code.</p><p>This project is an AI factory: Drake gives AI agents jobs, they build and check software, and you can <a href=\"/now/\">watch the work on the live floor</a>. It is a project in progress. Watch what gets checked and what still needs work.</p><p><strong>Vibe coding</strong> means describing what you want to an AI and working with it to make the code. You choose the goal, try the result, and tell it what needs to change.</p><p><strong>Your first 15-minute session:</strong> aim to make a tiny page about something you enjoy and open it in your browser. A title and a few sentences are enough. Take longer if you need to.</p><nav class=\"learn-jump\" aria-label=\"Learning guide\"><a href=\"#ask-ai\">Ask your AI</a><a href=\"#first-project\">Make your first page</a><a href=\"#workflow\">Go further</a></nav></header>\n<section class=\"learn-begin\" id=\"ask-ai\" aria-labelledby=\"ask-title\"><p class=\"learn-eyebrow\">01 / Understand this site</p><h2 id=\"ask-title\">Ask the AI in your browser</h2><aside id=\"learn-chrome\" class=\"learn-chrome\" hidden aria-label=\"Chrome toolbar hint\"><span class=\"learn-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</span><p>If you see <strong>Ask Gemini</strong> at the top-right of your Chrome toolbar, click it, then paste this prompt.</p><p class=\"learn-small\">Follow Google's first-use setup if asked. No button? Use the option below. Availability depends on your device, region, language, account, and rollout. <a href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/17140089?hl=en\">Check Google's availability guide</a>.</p></aside><p>Open <a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/\">Gemini</a>, or any AI assistant you already use, and paste the prompt below. You can keep this page open beside your conversation.</p><div class=\"learn-prompt\"><p class=\"learn-caption\" id=\"guide-label\">Prompt to understand this site</p><p id=\"prompt-guide\" class=\"learn-prompt-text\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"guide-label\">I am new to coding. Please read https://www.aienos.com/learn/ and explain what this project is in everyday language. Walk me through this website and starting my own tiny project, one step at a time. Explain unfamiliar words, tell me where to click, and wait for me after each step. Start by helping me understand what I can watch at https://www.aienos.com/now/. If you cannot read a page, ask me to paste its text instead of guessing.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"learn-copy\" data-copy=\"prompt-guide\" hidden aria-label=\"Copy prompt to understand this site\">Copy</button><span class=\"learn-copy-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><p class=\"learn-small\">A prompt is simply a message you give the AI. Copy it with the button, or select the text and copy it yourself. If the assistant cannot read the page, paste the part you want explained.</p></section>\n<section class=\"learn-begin\" id=\"first-project\" aria-labelledby=\"first-title\"><p class=\"learn-eyebrow\">02 / Make something small</p><h2 id=\"first-title\">Make a tiny web page</h2><p>Pick a hobby, a favourite place, or something you want to explain. Ask your assistant to turn it into a page you can open. If it cannot create files for you, it can explain how to save one.</p><div class=\"learn-prompt\"><p class=\"learn-caption\" id=\"make-label\">Prompt to make your page</p><p id=\"prompt-make\" class=\"learn-prompt-text\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"make-label\">Help me make my first tiny web page about a hobby I enjoy. Ask which hobby, then make one page with a title, a short introduction, and three things I like about it. Keep it in a single HTML file. Explain how to save it and open it in my browser, using instructions for my device. If you have a preview, show it too. Explain each step in everyday words and wait for me to try it. Do not publish it yet.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"learn-copy\" data-copy=\"prompt-make\" hidden aria-label=\"Copy prompt to make your page\">Copy</button><span class=\"learn-copy-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><p class=\"learn-done\"><strong>Look for:</strong> your own title and words on a page in your browser.</p></section>\n<section class=\"learn-begin\" aria-labelledby=\"check-title\"><p class=\"learn-eyebrow\">03 / Try it yourself</p><h2 id=\"check-title\">Check what you made</h2><p>Make the browser window narrow. Read the page. Try its links. Tell the AI what happened in your own words. You do not need to know the code to notice a problem.</p><div class=\"learn-prompt\"><p class=\"learn-caption\" id=\"check-label\">Prompt to check your page</p><p id=\"prompt-check\" class=\"learn-prompt-text\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"check-label\">Help me check the page I made. Tell me how to open it, read it at a narrow phone-sized width, and try every link. Give me one check at a time and ask what I actually see. If something is wrong, help me fix it and repeat that check. Separate what you tested from what you still need me to try. Explain any code changes in plain words.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"learn-copy\" data-copy=\"prompt-check\" hidden aria-label=\"Copy prompt to check your page\">Copy</button><span class=\"learn-copy-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><p class=\"learn-done\"><strong>Look for:</strong> readable text and links that take you where you expected. An AI saying it works is a reason to check.</p></section>\n<section class=\"learn-begin\" aria-labelledby=\"share-title\"><p class=\"learn-eyebrow\">04 / Share when ready</p><h2 id=\"share-title\">Publish your project on Radicle</h2><p>Radicle lets people share a project's files and its record of changes. Your assistant can help with the setup, which may take a separate session. Start with <a href=\"https://radicle.dev/guides/user\">Radicle's getting-started guide</a> and see this project's work in <a href=\"/forge/\">the forge</a>.</p><p>GitHub suspended the aien-spark organisation on 2026-11-07, so this project now publishes on Radicle.</p><div class=\"learn-prompt\"><p class=\"learn-caption\" id=\"share-label\">Prompt to share on Radicle</p><p id=\"prompt-share\" class=\"learn-prompt-text\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"share-label\">Help me share the source files of my tiny project on Radicle. Read https://radicle.dev/guides/user and ask what device I use before giving setup instructions. Explain Git (the record of changes), Radicle (sharing that record), and a repository (the project folder with its history). Help me install what I need and save my first change. Explain what becomes public, check for private information, and ask me before publishing. Then help me verify that another person can retrieve it. Show me https://www.aienos.com/forge/ as this project&#x27;s example. Explain that publishing source does not automatically host a live website. If you cannot use my computer, guide me one step at a time.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"learn-copy\" data-copy=\"prompt-share\" hidden aria-label=\"Copy prompt to share on radicle\">Copy</button><span class=\"learn-copy-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><p class=\"learn-done\"><strong>Look for:</strong> a project address another person can use to get your files. Sharing source files does not automatically put a live website online.</p></section><section class=\"learn-ready\"><h2>Ready for a more detailed working loop?</h2><p>Keep these habits as your projects grow. The original guide and starter brief below explain how to ask for a change, check the evidence, and keep a record.</p></section>"
text slcss "/* Learn-only layout. Colours and type come from the official brand tokens. */\nbody { background: var(--bg-primary); }\n.learn-page { --learn-ink: var(--bg-primary); --learn-paper: var(--text-primary); --learn-copper: var(--accent); --learn-muted: var(--text-secondary); --learn-rule: var(--border); max-width: var(--container-4xl); padding: 0 var(--space-6) var(--space-14); font: 400 16px/24px var(--font-sans); }\n.learn-page h1, .learn-page h2, .learn-page h3, .learn-page blockquote { font-family: var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: normal; }\n.learn-page .learn-intro { padding: var(--space-10) 0 var(--space-8); }\n.learn-page .learn-intro h1 { font-size: 36px; line-height: 40px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: var(--space-6); letter-spacing: normal; }\n.learn-page .learn-lede { font-size: 18px; line-height: 28px; }\n.learn-page h2, .learn-page .learn-margin h2, .learn-page .learn-outro h2 { font-size: 18px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: 600; }\n.learn-page h3 { font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 600; }\n.learn-page p, .learn-page dd, .learn-page .learn-steps p { color: var(--text-primary); }\n.learn-page a { color: var(--accent); }\n.learn-page a:hover { color: var(--accent-hover); }\n.learn-page :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--focus-ring); outline-offset: 4px; }\n.learn-page .learn-eyebrow { font: 600 12px/16px var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .2em; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }\n.learn-begin { padding: var(--space-8) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); scroll-margin-top: 96px; }\n.learn-chrome { position: relative; padding: var(--space-6); padding-right: var(--space-14); margin: var(--space-4) 0; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--bg-secondary); }\n.learn-arrow { position: absolute; top: var(--space-3); right: var(--space-4); font-size: 32px; line-height: 40px; color: var(--accent); }\n.learn-page [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n.learn-page .learn-small { font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--text-tertiary); }\n.learn-prompt { padding: var(--space-6); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); background: var(--bg-card); margin: var(--space-4) 0; }\n.learn-page .learn-prompt-text { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font: 400 16px/24px var(--font-sans); user-select: text; }\n.learn-copy { min-height: 44px; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-5); border: 1px solid var(--accent-fill); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--accent-fill); color: var(--on-accent-fill); font: 600 14px/20px var(--font-sans); cursor: pointer; }\n.learn-copy:hover { background: var(--accent-fill-hover); }\n.learn-copy-status { display: inline-block; margin-left: var(--space-3); font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-primary); }\n.learn-done { border-left: 2px solid var(--accent); padding-left: var(--space-4); }\n.learn-ready { padding-top: var(--space-10); }\n.learn-page .learn-section { gap: var(--space-8); padding: var(--space-10) 0; }\n.learn-page .learn-brief code, .learn-page .learn-steps li::before { font-family: var(--font-mono); }\n@media (max-width: 760px) { .learn-page { padding: 0 var(--space-4) var(--space-10); } .learn-page .learn-intro { padding-top: var(--space-8); } .learn-prompt { padding: var(--space-4); } }\n"
text sljs "/* Generated by the seeded Omega site builder. No network or storage calls. */\n(() => {\n  'use strict';\n  const hint = document.getElementById('learn-chrome');\n  const ua = navigator.userAgentData;\n  const brands = ua && Array.isArray(ua.brands) ? ua.brands.map(item => item.brand) : [];\n  const excluded = brands.some(brand => /Edge|Brave|Opera/i.test(brand)) || /Edg|OPR|Opera|Brave|Android|iPhone|iPad/i.test(navigator.userAgent) || !!navigator.brave;\n  if (hint && ua && ua.mobile === false && brands.includes('Google Chrome') && !excluded) hint.hidden = false;\n  document.querySelectorAll('.learn-copy').forEach(button => {\n    button.hidden = false;\n    button.addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      const source = document.getElementById(button.dataset.copy);\n      const status = button.parentElement.querySelector('.learn-copy-status');\n      try {\n        if (!navigator.clipboard || !navigator.clipboard.writeText) throw new Error('clipboard unavailable');\n        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(source.textContent);\n        status.textContent = 'Copied. Paste it into your assistant.';\n      } catch (_) {\n        const range = document.createRange();\n        range.selectNodeContents(source);\n        const selection = window.getSelection();\n        selection.removeAllRanges(); selection.addRange(range);\n        source.focus();\n        status.textContent = \"Select the prompt and copy it using your device\\'s Copy command.\";\n      }\n    });\n  });\n})();\n"
text sltokens "/* Sovereign Intelligence / AienOS brand tokens, compiled from tokens.json. Themes: dark (default), light, contrast, cvd. Set <html data-theme=\"...\">. */\n:root, [data-theme=\"dark\"] {\n  --bg-primary: #0a0a0f;\n  --bg-secondary: #111118;\n  --bg-card: #14141f;\n  --bg-card-glass: rgba(20, 20, 31, 0.4);\n  --bg-card-faint: rgba(20, 20, 31, 0.3);\n  --bg-glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n  --bg-header: rgba(5, 6, 8, 0.7);\n  --sidebar-bg: #0c0c14;\n  --fill-input: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n  --fill-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\n  --col-stripe: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);\n  --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  --border-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  --border-faint: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n  --text-primary: #ffffff;\n  --text-secondary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n  --text-tertiary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n  --accent: #63b3ed;\n  --accent-hover: #4299e1;\n  --accent-fill: #2563eb;\n  --accent-fill-hover: #1d4ed8;\n  --on-accent-fill: #ffffff;\n  --pill: #ffffff;\n  --on-pill: #000000;\n  --focus-ring: #7dd3fc;\n  --success: #00d294;\n  --success-fill: #00bb7f;\n  --success-tint: rgba(0, 187, 127, 0.1);\n  --success-line: rgba(0, 187, 127, 0.2);\n  --success-edge: rgba(0, 187, 127, 0.25);\n  --warning: #fcbb00;\n  --warning-fill: #f99c00;\n  --warning-tint: rgba(249, 156, 0, 0.1);\n  --warning-line: rgba(249, 156, 0, 0.2);\n  --danger: #ff6568;\n  --danger-fill: #fb2c36;\n  --danger-tint: rgba(251, 44, 54, 0.1);\n  --danger-line: rgba(251, 44, 54, 0.2);\n  --info: #54a2ff;\n  --info-tint: rgba(48, 128, 255, 0.1);\n  --info-line: rgba(48, 128, 255, 0.2);\n  --track: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  --live-dot: #ffffff;\n  --ember: #ff735e;\n  --brand-blue: #2563eb;\n  --brand-cyan: #22d3ee;\n  --series-1: #3987e5;\n  --series-2: #d95926;\n  --series-3: #199e70;\n  --series-4: #c98500;\n  --series-5: #d55181;\n  --series-6: #008300;\n  --series-7: #9085e9;\n  --series-8: #e66767;\n  --heat-mid: #383835;\n  --heat-0: rgba(57, 135, 229, 0.06);\n  --heat-1: rgba(57, 135, 229, 0.18);\n  --heat-2: rgba(57, 135, 229, 0.34);\n  --heat-3: rgba(57, 135, 229, 0.55);\n  --heat-4: rgba(57, 135, 229, 0.8);\n  --glow-live: 0 0 10px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n  --ring-input: 0 0 0 2px rgba(48, 128, 255, 0.5);\n}\n[data-theme=\"light\"] {\n  --bg-primary: #f8fafc;\n  --bg-secondary: #ffffff;\n  --bg-card: #ffffff;\n  --bg-card-glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n  --bg-card-faint: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n  --bg-glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n  --bg-header: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.7);\n  --sidebar-bg: #f1f5f9;\n  --fill-input: #ffffff;\n  --fill-hover: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);\n  --col-stripe: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.043);\n  --border: #e2e8f0;\n  --border-strong: #cbd5e1;\n  --border-faint: #f1f5f9;\n  --text-primary: #1a202c;\n  --text-secondary: #5a6578;\n  --text-tertiary: #334155;\n  --accent: #1d4ed8;\n  --accent-hover: #1e40af;\n  --accent-fill: #2563eb;\n  --accent-fill-hover: #1d4ed8;\n  --on-accent-fill: #ffffff;\n  --pill: #0a0a0f;\n  --on-pill: #ffffff;\n  --focus-ring: #1d4ed8;\n  --success: #047857;\n  --success-fill: #00bb7f;\n  --success-tint: rgba(0, 187, 127, 0.1);\n  --success-line: rgba(0, 187, 127, 0.3);\n  --success-edge: rgba(0, 187, 127, 0.35);\n  --warning: #b75000;\n  --warning-fill: #f99c00;\n  --warning-tint: rgba(249, 156, 0, 0.12);\n  --warning-line: rgba(249, 156, 0, 0.35);\n  --danger: #b91c1c;\n  --danger-fill: #fb2c36;\n  --danger-tint: rgba(251, 44, 54, 0.08);\n  --danger-line: rgba(251, 44, 54, 0.3);\n  --info: #1447e6;\n  --info-tint: rgba(48, 128, 255, 0.1);\n  --info-line: rgba(48, 128, 255, 0.3);\n  --track: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);\n  --live-dot: #0a0a0f;\n  --ember: #a9462b;\n  --brand-blue: #2563eb;\n  --brand-cyan: #0891b2;\n  --series-1: #2a78d6;\n  --series-2: #eb6834;\n  --series-3: #1baf7a;\n  --series-4: #eda100;\n  --series-5: #e87ba4;\n  --series-6: #008300;\n  --series-7: #4a3aa7;\n  --series-8: #e34948;\n  --heat-mid: #f0efec;\n  --heat-0: rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.06);\n  --heat-1: rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.18);\n  --heat-2: rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.34);\n  --heat-3: rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.55);\n  --heat-4: rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.8);\n  --ring-input: 0 0 0 2px rgba(29, 78, 216, 0.35);\n}\n[data-theme=\"contrast\"] {\n  --bg-primary: #000000;\n  --bg-secondary: #000000;\n  --bg-card: #000000;\n  --bg-card-glass: #000000;\n  --bg-card-faint: #000000;\n  --bg-glass: #000000;\n  --bg-header: #000000;\n  --sidebar-bg: #000000;\n  --fill-input: #000000;\n  --fill-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n  --col-stripe: #000000;\n  --border: #ffffff;\n  --border-strong: #ffffff;\n  --border-faint: #ffffff;\n  --text-primary: #ffffff;\n  --text-secondary: #ffffff;\n  --text-tertiary: #ffffff;\n  --accent: #7fd4ff;\n  --accent-hover: #b3e6ff;\n  --accent-fill: #0000ee;\n  --accent-fill-hover: #0000aa;\n  --on-accent-fill: #ffffff;\n  --pill: #ffffff;\n  --on-pill: #000000;\n  --focus-ring: #ffff00;\n  --success-tint: #000000;\n  --success-line: #00d294;\n  --success-edge: #00d294;\n  --warning-tint: #000000;\n  --warning-line: #fcbb00;\n  --danger-tint: #000000;\n  --danger-line: #ff6568;\n  --info-tint: #000000;\n  --info-line: #54a2ff;\n  --track: #333333;\n  --live-dot: #ffffff;\n  --ember: #ff9b88;\n  --brand-blue: #2563eb;\n  --brand-cyan: #22d3ee;\n  --heat-0: #0a1a33;\n  --heat-1: #123366;\n  --heat-2: #1f5299;\n  --heat-3: #3a7fd6;\n  --heat-4: #7fd4ff;\n  --ring-input: 0 0 0 2px #ffff00;\n}\n[data-theme=\"cvd\"] {\n  --success: #38bdf8;\n  --success-fill: #0ea5e9;\n  --success-tint: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.1);\n  --success-line: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2);\n  --success-edge: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.25);\n  --danger: #f472b6;\n  --danger-fill: #ec4899;\n  --danger-tint: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.1);\n  --danger-line: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.2);\n}\n:root {\n  --space-0_5: 2px;\n  --space-1: 4px;\n  --space-1_5: 6px;\n  --space-2: 8px;\n  --space-2_5: 10px;\n  --space-3: 12px;\n  --space-4: 16px;\n  --space-5: 20px;\n  --space-6: 24px;\n  --space-8: 32px;\n  --space-10: 40px;\n  --space-14: 56px;\n  --radius-bar: 1px;\n  --radius-sm: 4px;\n  --radius-md: 6px;\n  --radius-lg: 8px;\n  --radius-xl: 12px;\n  --radius-2xl: 16px;\n  --radius-full: 9999px;\n  --container-4xl: 896px;\n  --container-6xl: 1152px;\n  --header-height: 68px;\n  --sidebar-width: 240px;\n  --uptime-height: 32px;\n  --dot: 8px;\n  --blur-xl: 24px;\n  --font-sans: \"Inter\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: \"JetBrains Mono\", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n}\n.display { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 48px; line-height: 48px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.025em; }\n.page-title { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 36px; line-height: 40px; font-weight: 700; }\n.section-title { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 18px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: 600; }\n.card-title { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 600; }\n.eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }\n.body { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 400; }\n.body-sm { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400; }\n.label { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 500; }\n.button { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600; }\n.meta { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 500; }\n.caption { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 400; }\n.badge { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 10px; line-height: 15px; font-weight: 500; }\n.table-head { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 10px; line-height: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }\n.stat-value { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 28px; line-height: 32px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n.data { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400; }\n.mono-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px; line-height: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }\n"
text slcp "assets/learn-guide.css"
text sljp "js/learn-guide.js"
text sltp "assets/learn-tokens.css"
fn sl_assets to void
st_open sltp
sr_raw sltokens
sr_close
